menu "ESP32-S3-DevKitC sample"

    config APP_LED_GPIO
        int "RGB LED (WS2812) GPIO"
        default 38
        help
            The board's addressable RGB LED: GPIO 48 on DevKitC-1 v1.0, GPIO 38 on
            v1.1. The board version is printed on the board.

    config APP_BUTTON_GPIO
        int "Button GPIO"
        default 0
        help
            The BOOT button (GPIO 0, low when pressed).

endmenu
